ne most glorious on his head. Three [There] goeth before him a host of spirits like men with Trumpets and well sounding Cymballs, and all other sorts of musi","startCodePoint":9214,"endCodePointExclusive":9521,"derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/peterson-sloane3825-normalized-text.txt","sourceId":"public:goetia_peterson_sloane3825"}},{"witnessId":"peterson-sloane3825","source":"goetic-upper:peterson-sloane3825:Lucifer","target":"peterson-sloane3825:chief:68","type":"precedes-in-created-order","sourceMeaning":"Belial was created next after Lucifer; source ordering is not a father-child statement.","evidence":{"text":"pirit is called Belial , 78 he is a mighty king and powerfull; he was Created next after Lucifer, & is of his order; he appeareth in y e forme of a Beautiful angel sitting in a Charriot of fire, speaking w th a comly voice, declaring that he fell first & amongst y e worthier & wiser sort w ch went before Michael & other heav","startCodePoint":51028,"endCodePointExclusive":51354,"derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/peterson-sloane3825-normalized-text.txt","sourceId":"public:goetia_peterson_sloane3825"}},{"witnessId":"peterson-sloane3825","source":"goetic-upper:peterson-sloane3825:four-quarter-rulers","target":"peterson-sloane3825:catalogue","type":"jurisdiction-over-collective","sourceMeaning":"The catalogue is collectively under four quarter kings. Individual king-to-chief allocation and exact direction/name alignment remain open.","evidence":{"text":"These 72 kings are under the power of Amaymon, Corson, Ziminiar [*Zimimar], & Goap 86 w ch are kings ruling in y e 4 quarters East, West, North, & south, and are not to be called forth except it be upon great occasions But Invoked & commanded to send such & such spirit as are under their rule and power, as is shewed in y e following Invocations, or conjurations &c. 86: W: Amoymon, Gorson, Zymymar, Goap; Scot: Amaymon, Gorson","startCodePoint":58933,"endCodePointExclusive":59361,"derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/peterson-sloane3825-normalized-text.txt","sourceId":"public:goetia_peterson_sloane3825"}},{"witnessId":"peterson-sloane3825","source":"goetic-upper:peterson-sloane3825:Amaymon","target":"peterson-sloane3825:chief:32","type":"source-reported-power-over","sourceMeaning":"Asmoday under Amaymon; not primordial parentage.","evidence":{"text":"Goose, he sitteth on an Infernall dragon carring a Launce and a flagg in his hands, he is y e first & chifiest under y e power of Amaymon , & goeth before all others: when the [105r] Exorcist hath a mind to call him, lett it be abroad , 35 and lett him stand on his feet all y e Time of action, w th ","sourceId":"public:goetia_peterson_sloane3825","derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/peterson-sloane3825-normalized-text.txt","startCodePoint":25413,"endCodePointExclusive":25713}},{"witnessId":"peterson-sloane3825","source":"goetic-upper:peterson-sloane3825:Amaymon","target":"peterson-sloane3825:chief:70","type":"source-reported-power-over","sourceMeaning":"Seere under Amaymon in the chief70 passage; do not transfer this direction across different witnesses.","evidence":{"text":"nder Amaymon in the South. The 70 th spirit in order is called Seere , 80 he is a Mighty Prince and powerfull under Amaymon, king of y e East he appeareth in y e forme of a Beautifull Man, riding on a strong horse w th wings: his office is to goe & come, and to","sourceId":"public:goetia_peterson_sloane3825","derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/peterson-sloane3825-normalized-text.txt","startCodePoint":52578,"endCodePointExclusive":52839}},{"witnessId":"de-laurence-1916","source":"goetic-upper:de-laurence-1916:Lucifer","target":"de-laurence-1916:chief:9","type":"receives-obedience-from","sourceMeaning":"Paimon is obedient to Lucifer; not asserted begetting.","evidence":{"text":" Spirit in this Order is Paimon, a Great King, and very obedient unto Lucifer . He appeareth in the form of a Man sitting upon a Dromedary with a Crown most glorious upon his head. There goeth before him also an Host of Spirits, like Men with Trumpets and well sounding Cymbals, and all other sorts of Music","startCodePoint":29722,"endCodePointExclusive":30029,"derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/de-laurence-1916-normalized-text.txt","sourceId":"public:goetia_de_laurence_1916"}},{"witnessId":"de-laurence-1916","source":"goetic-upper:de-laurence-1916:Lucifer","target":"de-laurence-1916:chief:68","type":"precedes-in-created-order","sourceMeaning":"Belial was created next after Lucifer; source ordering is not a father-child statement.","evidence":{"text":"-eighth Spirit is Belial. He is a Mighty and a Powerful King, and was created next after Lucifer . He appeareth in the Form of Two Beautiful Angels sitting in a Chariot of Fire. He speaketh with a Comely Voice, and declareth that he fell first from among the worthier sort, that were before Michael, and other Heavenly Angels.","startCodePoint":62850,"endCodePointExclusive":63176,"derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/de-laurence-1916-normalized-text.txt","sourceId":"public:goetia_de_laurence_1916"}},{"witnessId":"de-laurence-1916","source":"goetic-upper:de-laurence-1916:four-quarter-rulers","target":"de-laurence-1916:catalogue","type":"jurisdiction-over-collective","sourceMeaning":"The catalogue is collectively under four quarter kings. Individual king-to-chief allocation and exact direction/name alignment remain open.","evidence":{"text":"These 72 Kings be under the Power of Amaymon , Corson , Zimimay or Ziminair , and Göap , who are the Four Great Kings ruling in the Four Quarters, or Cardinal Points, [30] viz.: East, West, North, and South, and are not to be called forth except it be upon Great Occasions; but are to be Invocated and Commanded to send such or such a Spirit that is under their Power and Rule, as is shown in the following Invocations or Conjur","startCodePoint":67447,"endCodePointExclusive":67875,"derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/de-laurence-1916-normalized-text.txt","sourceId":"public:goetia_de_laurence_1916"}},{"witnessId":"de-laurence-1916","source":"goetic-upper:de-laurence-1916:Amaymon","target":"de-laurence-1916:chief:32","type":"source-reported-power-over","sourceMeaning":"Asmoday under Amaymon; not primordial parentage.","evidence":{"text":"e. He sitteth upon an Infernal Dragon, and beareth in his hand a Lance with a Banner. He is first and choicest under the Power of Amaymon , he goeth before all other. When the Exorcist hath a mind to call him, let it be abroad, and let him stand on his feet all the time of action, with his Cap or He","sourceId":"public:goetia_de_laurence_1916","derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/de-laurence-1916-normalized-text.txt","startCodePoint":42887,"endCodePointExclusive":43187}},{"witnessId":"de-laurence-1916","source":"goetic-upper:de-laurence-1916:Amaymon","target":"de-laurence-1916:chief:70","type":"source-reported-power-over","sourceMeaning":"Seere under Amaymon in the chief70 passage; do not transfer this direction across different witnesses.","evidence":{"text":" Seere , Sear , or Seir .—The Seventieth Spirit is Seere, Sear, or Seir. He is a Mighty Prince, and Powerful, under Amaymon , King of the East. He appeareth in the Form of a Beautiful Man, riding upon a Winged Horse. His Office is to go and come; and to bring ab","sourceId":"public:goetia_de_laurence_1916","derivedTextPath":"state/research/upper-legion-color/de-laurence-1916-normalized-text.txt","startCodePoint":64171,"endCodePointExclusive":64433}}],"proposedGraphExtension":{"entities":[{"id":"goetic-upper:peterson-sloane3825:Lucifer","nativeName":"Lucifer","aliases":[],"unit":"source-named-superior","tradition":"Solomonic Goetia","witnessId":"peterson-sloane3825","position":{"generation":null,"sequence":null,"cyclicCoordinate":null,"orientation":null},"sourceRefs":["public:goetia_peterson_sloane